  "title": "Which gates the families read",
  "status": "Proved",
  "claim": "Proved by hand: a cut reads AND; a component with no satisfying state makes the network unsatisfiable, so every reading is 1 where both stored bits are 1; a cut leaf read only from outside is never negated. Computed on 43,091 networks in five frozen families: AND, OR, a single bit and constants are read, never NOT a_1 (P4 failed). Post hoc: names read the parity of a closed leaf's two class bits.",
